    {
      "id": "8ce91565-208c-5b53-986e-154fcc3256dd",
      "name": "Guide: 01 · Triggers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 · Triggers\nManual entry or Monday 03:00 schedule.\n**UNPUBLISHED: schedule is not running.**\nDo not execute during the demonstration.",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 620,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1cf049dd-a774-52de-aea8-6c37bb5c3ec7",
      "name": "Guide: 02 · Official acquisition",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        320,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 · Official acquisition\n**POST /ingestion/run** → FastAPI.\nRegistry approval, robots/AI opt-outs, TLS, type validation and SHA-256 provenance/deduplication.\nReturns counts/results; no new download in this review.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 620,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9d7c3a80-d6b7-5177-82f9-36ffa32b45e5",
      "name": "Guide: 03 · Processing and chunks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        780,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 · Processing + two chunkers\n**POST /index/run** → FastAPI.\nPyMuPDF text layer; HTML/table structure; normalization and metadata.\n**Structure-aware** and **recursive** chunks.\nImage-only corpus PDFs are skipped; this ingestion path does not OCR them.",
        "width": 600,
        "height": 620,
        "color": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "235fbff3-4cbd-53c3-9be9-5987ad81a7a9",
      "name": "Guide: 04 · Embeddings and Qdrant",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1420,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 04 · Inside the indexing request\nOllama **bge-m3**, 1024 dimensions.\n`official_docs_structure` + `official_docs_recursive`.\nVectors + document/page/heading/URL/SHA metadata.\n**Indexing recreates both collections.** No separate executable embedding node.",
        "width": 430,
        "height": 620,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad13f9e5-1f43-54a9-a1ce-4b1952c66dfc",
      "name": "Guide: 05 · Runtime summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1890,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 · Runtime summary\n`ingestion_counts`, `documents_indexed`, `documents_skipped`, `collection_points`.\nValues come from the run, not historical metrics.\nFailures stop the chain; no dedicated error response node.",
        "width": 430,
        "height": 620,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "15e3219f-1ceb-5869-9c30-9c8351860ee5",
      "name": "Guide: Safety and legend",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        610
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Safety gate\nAdmin endpoints require **X-Admin-Key** on the hardened backend; without a configured admin key they fail closed. Credential setup and release require approval. No ingestion, indexing, schedule activation or Qdrant write is authorized by this diagram.\n### Legend · annotations do not execute\n**Icons + wires:** real n8n execution. **Notes:** explanations only.\nBlue = input/answer (closest available to teal); purple = routing; green = knowledge; gold = PDF/processing; red = safety; gray = infrastructure.\nLLM components and deterministic services run **inside FastAPI**; none plans or negotiates autonomously.",
        "width": 2400,
        "height": 220,
        "color": 3
      }
    }
  ],
